able only to users with the intended\n  administrator-level access; non-administrator project users cannot change\n  it.\n- The change is covered by the existing Dashboard build pipeline (pipeline\n  green on the merged change).\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-3 (P1): Administrators can enable/disable inference auditing per\n  project from the Dashboard.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":29635,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9237710a8f900247","agent_id":"a76fe8965019b7c94","session_id":"d259959c-9f88-4e8b-bf9c-c556eba940a6","uuid":"303b9697-ddf5-442e-8813-a896866823b2","timestamp":"2026-10-22T16:44:51.074Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9010"}
